{"words": [{"text": "۞ وَإِذِ", "translation": "And when"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَسْقَىٰ", "translation": "asked (for) water"}, {"text": "مُوسَىٰ", "translation": "Musa"}, {"text": "لِقَوْمِهِۦ", "translation": "for his people"}, {"text": "فَقُلْنَا", "translation": "[so] We said"}, {"text": "ٱضْرِب", "translation": "Strike"}, {"text": "بِّعَصَاكَ", "translation": "with your staff"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَجَرَ ۖ", "translation": "the stone"}, {"text": "فَٱنفَجَرَتْ", "translation": "Then gushed forth"}, {"text": "مِنْهُ", "translation": "from it"}, {"text": "ٱثْنَتَا", "translation": "(of)"}, {"text": "عَشْرَةَ", "translation": "twelve"}, {"text": "عَيْنًۭا ۖ", "translation": "springs"}, {"text": "قَدْ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "عَلِمَ", "translation": "knew"}, {"text": "كُلُّ", "translation": "all"}, {"text": "أُنَاسٍۢ", "translation": "(the) people"}, {"text": "مَّشْرَبَهُمْ ۖ", "translation": "their drinking place"}, {"text": "كُلُوا۟", "translation": "Eat"}, {"text": "وَٱشْرَبُوا۟", "translation": "and drink"}, {"text": "مِن", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "رِّزْقِ", "translation": "(the) provision (of)"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "and (do) not"}, {"text": "تَعْثَوْا۟", "translation": "act wickedly"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "in"}, {"text": "ٱلْأَرْضِ", "translation": "the earth"}, {"text": "مُفْسِدِينَ", "translation": "spreading corruption"}], "sahih": "And [recall] when Moses prayed for water for his people, so We said, \"Strike with your staff the stone.\" And there gushed forth from it twelve springs, and every people [i.e., tribe] knew its watering place. \"Eat and drink from the provision of Allāh, and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption.\""}